{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyLzIwMDAlMjBNdWxlcyUyMCUyODIwMjIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"2000 Mules","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nTz0ZDc2PdHpn07O37Jmq2vaSPV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fUl6pTtudCMcCG0XQDvn9dDe24N.jpg","description":"Bestselling author and award-winning filmmaker, Dinesh D’Souza, exposes widespread coordinated voter fraud in the 2020 election sufficient to change the overall outcome. Drawing on research provided by the election integrity group, True the Vote, “2000 Mules” offers two types of evidence: geotracking and video. The geotracking evidence, based on a database of ten trillion cell phone pings, exposes an elaborate network of professional operatives, called mules, delivering fraudulent votes to mail-in boxes in the five key states where the election was decided. Video evidence obtained from official surveillance cameras corroborates the cellular positioning data. The film concludes by exploring ways to assist in the prevention of election fraud in future democratic elections.\n\nRated NR · Released 20 May 2022 · United States of America · Language: English · 86 min\nStudio: D'Souza Media, Salem Media Group\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"86 min","cast":["Dinesh D'Souza","Catherine Engelbrecht","Larry Elder","Eric Metaxas","Sebastian Gorka","Dennis Prager","Debbie D'Souza","Gregg Phillips"],"director":["Dinesh D'Souza","Bruce Schooley"],"released":"2022-05-20T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"They thought we’d never find out. They were wrong.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Dinesh D'Souza","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/od42p7dSa9VN9vbuT8OnxlTZv3Z.jpg"},{"name":"Dinesh D'Souza","character":"Self / Narrator","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/od42p7dSa9VN9vbuT8OnxlTZv3Z.jpg"},{"name":"Catherine Engelbrecht","character":"Self","photo":"https://im